        "message": "wp1334: khong ghi credential Codex vao CODEX_HOME nam trong kho git (r2)\n\n- scripts/tl_gws.py: them _trong_kho_git(path), di tu dich len goc tren hai\n  chuoi (tu vung va realpath), lstat muc .git. _bootstrap_agent_creds tra\n  KHONG DO DUOC va khong tao tep/thu muc nao khi dich nam trong kho.\n  cmd_agent_creds_set --codex chi doc, co y khong qua chot (ghi trong docstring).\n- ops/cloud_agent_creds.py: _ghi_dau hoi cung chot qua tl_gws; khong nap duoc\n  tl_gws thi cung khong ghi.\n- ops/cloud_agent_creds_test.py: 7 ca pd1..pd7 (M5 a-g, du lieu gia), 10 dot\n  bien PD*, loai tep dot bien \"tlgws\" chay tren ban sao tam.\n- RELEASE_MANIFEST.json tai sinh; changelog.d/wp-1334.md.\n\nDo tren base ded5d41: bo test 52/52, 80/80; tren head 59/59, 90/90.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrZ6bCzNXoqjwqyrJTq",
